// 用例目的：向量参数 maturities 传入不符合文档格式的字符串（XYZ）—— 实测包装器宽松接受，记录实际行为
@testing:case="createCreditParCurve accepts maturities malformed XYZ (no validation)"
rCpcR3MatX = caplib::createCreditParCurve(asOfDate, currency, "BOND_CREDIT", ["CFETS-SHCH-GTJA","CFETS-SHCH-GTJA","CFETS-SHCH-GTJA"], ["CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP","CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP","CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP"], ["XYZ","3Y","5Y"], [0.008,0.010,0.012], ["SPOTSTART","SPOTSTART","SPOTSTART"], "TF_CPC_R3_MATX", false)
