// 用例目的：向量参数 startConventions 传入错误类型的向量（INT 向量），验证元素类型校验（预期：抛异常）
@testing:case="createCreditParCurve rejects wrong type for startConventions", exception=1
caplib::createCreditParCurve(asOfDate, currency, "BOND_CREDIT", ["CFETS-SHCH-GTJA","CFETS-SHCH-GTJA","CFETS-SHCH-GTJA"], ["CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP","CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP","CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP"], ["1Y","3Y","5Y"], [0.008,0.010,0.012], [1, 2, 3], "TF_CPC", false)

// 用例目的：向量参数 startConventions 传入部分空值的向量 —— 实测包装器宽松接受，记录实际行为
