// 用例目的：枚举向量参数 startConventions 传入文档取值 TODAYSTART（正常用例已覆盖 SPOTSTART），验证逐值接受（预期：不抛异常）
@testing:case="createCreditParCurve accepts startConventions TODAYSTART"
rCpcR3ScT = caplib::createCreditParCurve(asOfDate, currency, "BOND_CREDIT", ["CFETS-SHCH-GTJA","CFETS-SHCH-GTJA","CFETS-SHCH-GTJA"], ["CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP","CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP","CREDIT_DEFAULT_SWAP"], ["1Y","3Y","5Y"], [0.008,0.010,0.012], ["TODAYSTART","TODAYSTART","TODAYSTART"], "TF_CPC_R3_SCT", false)
